
>> shop := (List nĳ
	set: ['magazine'] by: ['books'],
	set: ['computer'] by: ['electronics'],
	set: ['lipstick'] by: ['cosmetics']
).
Utfier skriuwe: (shop hat: ['computer']), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (shop hat: ['sausage']), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (shop hat: ['computers']), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (shop hat: ['compute']), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (shop hat: ['2computer']), nije-rigel. 
